+<section class="card cfo-mapping-section" data-testid="cfo-mapping-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow ink">ЦФО</p><h2>Исходный ЦФО → ЦФО Инталев → узел 1С</h2></div></div><form method="post" action="/runs/{{ run.run_id }}/confirm-filled-cfo" class="bulk-confirm-card cfo-bulk-card" data-cfo-bulk-form data-testid="cfo-bulk-form"><input type="hidden" name="selections" value="[]" data-cfo-bulk-selections><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="1" data-cfo-bulk-confirm disabled>Подтверждаю все заполненные сопоставления ЦФО</label><p data-cfo-bulk-count>Будет применено: 0 ЦФО</p><p data-cfo-bulk-empty>Сначала заполните хотя бы одно новое соответствие.</p><button type="submit" data-cfo-bulk-submit disabled>Нет заполненных соответствий</button></form><div class="cfo-mapping-list">{% for entry in cfo_mapping_entries %}<article class="cfo-mapping-row{% if entry.confirmed %} is-confirmed{% endif %}" data-cfo-entry data-entry-key="{{ entry.entry_key }}" data-source-reporting-unit="{{ entry.source_reporting_unit }}" data-source-cfo="{{ entry.source_cfo }}" data-confirmed="{{ 'true' if entry.confirmed else 'false' }}" data-eligible="true"><div class="cfo-source-card"><strong>{{ entry.source_label }}</strong><span>{{ entry.row_count }} исходных строк</span>{% if entry.intalev_confirmed %}<small>ЦФО Инталев: {{ entry.intalev_label }}</small>{% endif %}</div>{% if entry.confirmed %}<div class="business-status cfo-confirmed-status"><strong>Сопоставление ЦФО подтверждено</strong><span>{{ entry.intalev_label }} → {{ entry.target_label }}</span></div>{% else %}<form method="post" action="/runs/{{ run.run_id }}/map-cfo" class="cfo-mapping-form" data-cfo-form><input type="hidden" name="source_reporting_unit" value="{{ entry.source_reporting_unit }}"><input type="h